<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <title>PennyLunch - Dinner From Your Pantry</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="description" content="PennyLunch turns the ingredients you already have into realistic dinner matches.">
    <meta name="pennylunch-deploy-probe" content="2026-07-06-sync-test">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#dc3f2f">
    <meta property="og:title" content="PennyLunch">
    <meta property="og:description" content="AI-ranked recipes from what you already have.">
    <meta property="og:image" content="/icon-512x512.png">
    <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json">
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="any">
    <link rel="icon" href="/pen.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png" sizes="180x180">
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: light;
        --page: oklch(0.985 0 0);
        --surface: oklch(0.997 0.004 145);
        --surface-soft: oklch(0.965 0.055 92);
        --ink: oklch(0.18 0.018 255);
        --muted: oklch(0.43 0.02 255);
        --border: oklch(0.875 0.018 92);
        --tomato: oklch(0.57 0.19 32);
        --tomato-deep: oklch(0.38 0.14 32);
        --tomato-soft: oklch(0.94 0.055 32);
        --herb: oklch(0.58 0.14 150);
        --herb-soft: oklch(0.955 0.04 150);
        --lemon: oklch(0.84 0.15 92);
        --lemon-soft: oklch(0.965 0.055 92);
        --blue: oklch(0.48 0.12 255);
        --blue-soft: oklch(0.955 0.028 255);
        --shadow: oklch(0.18 0.018 255 / 0.12);
        --ease-out: cubic-bezier(0.23, 1, 0.32, 1);
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html {
        background: var(--page);
        font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      }

      body {
        background:
          radial-gradient(0.7rem 0.42rem at 1.35rem 1.55rem, oklch(0.57 0.19 32 / 0.12) 0 62%, transparent 64%),
          radial-gradient(0.34rem 0.8rem at 6.7rem 2.4rem, oklch(0.58 0.14 150 / 0.11) 0 62%, transparent 65%),
          radial-gradient(0.2rem 0.2rem at 4.15rem 6.1rem, oklch(0.48 0.12 255 / 0.085) 0 68%, transparent 71%),
          radial-gradient(0.64rem 0.3rem at 8rem 6.65rem, oklch(0.84 0.15 92 / 0.18) 0 62%, transparent 65%),
          linear-gradient(180deg, color-mix(in oklch, var(--lemon-soft) 68%, var(--page)) 0, var(--page) 22rem);
        background-size: 10rem 10rem, 11rem 11rem, 7rem 7rem, 13rem 13rem, auto;
        color: var(--ink);
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100dvh;
      }

      a {
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      img {
        display: block;
        max-width: 100%;
      }

      .page-shell {
        overflow: clip;
      }

      .nav {
        align-items: center;
        display: flex;
        gap: 1rem;
        justify-content: space-between;
        margin-inline: auto;
        max-width: 76rem;
        padding: 1rem;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
      }

      .brand {
        align-items: center;
        display: inline-flex;
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 750;
        gap: 0.625rem;
      }

      .brand-mark {
        background: color-mix(in oklch, var(--lemon-soft) 70%, var(--tomato-soft));
        border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklch, var(--lemon) 52%, var(--tomato));
        border-radius: 0.875rem;
        height: 2.5rem;
        padding: 0.25rem;
        width: 2.5rem;
      }

      .nav-links {
        align-items: center;
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.5rem;
      }

      .nav-links a:not(.button) {
        border-radius: 999px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.925rem;
        font-weight: 650;
        padding: 0.625rem 0.75rem;
      }

      .button {
        align-items: center;
        border-radius: 999px;
        display: inline-flex;
        font-weight: 750;
        justify-content: center;
        min-height: 2.75rem;
        padding: 0.75rem 1.125rem;
        transition: background-color 160ms var(--ease-out), border-color 160ms var(--ease-out), color 160ms var(--ease-out), transform 140ms var(--ease-out);
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      .button:active {
        transform: scale(0.97);
      }

      .button-primary {
        background: var(--tomato);
        border: 1px solid var(--tomato);
        color: white;
      }

      .button-secondary {
        background: color-mix(in oklch, var(--surface) 76%, var(--blue-soft));
        border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklch, var(--border) 72%, var(--blue));
        color: var(--blue);
      }

      .hero {
        display: grid;
        gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem);
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.88fr) minmax(22rem, 1.12fr);
        margin-inline: auto;
        max-width: 76rem;
        padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem) 1rem clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 5rem);
      }

      .hero-copy {
        align-self: center;
        max-width: 38rem;
      }

      .hero-badge {
        align-items: center;
        background: color-mix(in oklch, var(--surface) 82%, var(--herb-soft));
        border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklch, var(--border) 62%, var(--herb));
        border-radius: 999px;
        color: oklch(0.31 0.095 150);
        display: inline-flex;
        font-size: 0.925rem;
        font-weight: 750;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        padding: 0.375rem 0.75rem 0.375rem 0.425rem;
      }

      .hero-badge img {
        height: 1.75rem;
        width: 1.75rem;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(3.25rem, 7.4vw, 6rem);
        letter-spacing: 0;
        line-height: 0.95;
        margin: 1.25rem 0 1rem;
        max-width: 13ch;
        text-wrap: balance;
      }

      .hero-copy p {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 1.7vw, 1.35rem);
        line-height: 1.55;
        margin: 0;
        max-width: 34rem;
        text-wrap: pretty;
      }

      .hero-actions {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
      }

      .hero-visual {
        align-self: center;
        min-width: 0;
        position: relative;
      }

      .mascot-orbit {
        align-items: center;
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 1rem;
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.875rem;
        left: -1.25rem;
        padding: 0.75rem;
        position: absolute;
        top: 1.5rem;
        width: min(18rem, 52vw);
        z-index: 2;
      }

      .mascot-orbit img {
        background: var(--lemon-soft);
        border-radius: 0.875rem;
        height: 4rem;
        padding: 0.35rem;
        width: 4rem;
      }

      .mascot-orbit strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        line-height: 1.2;
      }

      .mascot-orbit span {
        color: var(--muted);
        display: block;
        font-size: 0.825rem;
        line-height: 1.3;
        margin-top: 0.2rem;
      }

      .preview-frame {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 1rem;
        box-shadow: 0 0.5rem 1rem var(--shadow);
        height: clamp(30rem, 58vw, 42rem);
        overflow: hidden;
        position: relative;
      }

      .preview-frame iframe {
        border: 0;
        height: 100%;
        width: 100%;
      }

      .preview-ribbon {
        align-items: center;
        background: var(--lemon-soft);
        border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklch, var(--lemon) 70%, var(--border));
        border-radius: 999px;
        bottom: 1rem;
        color: oklch(0.35 0.08 82);
        display: inline-flex;
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        font-weight: 750;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        padding: 0.625rem 0.875rem;
        position: absolute;
        right: 1rem;
        z-index: 2;
      }

      .section {
        margin-inline: auto;
        max-width: 76rem;
        padding: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 5rem) 1rem;
      }

      .section h2 {
        font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4.5vw, 4.25rem);
        letter-spacing: 0;
        line-height: 1;
        margin: 0;
        max-width: 12ch;
        text-wrap: balance;
      }

      .section-intro {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin: 1rem 0 0;
        max-width: 42rem;
      }

      .signal-grid {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
        grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
        margin-top: 2rem;
      }

      .signal-panel {
        background: color-mix(in oklch, var(--surface) 88%, var(--lemon-soft));
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 1rem;
        padding: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2rem);
      }

      .signal-panel-large {
        min-height: 22rem;
      }

      .signal-stack {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
      }

      .signal-panel h3,
      .flow-card h3 {
        font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2vw, 1.75rem);
        line-height: 1.1;
        margin: 0;
      }

      .signal-panel p,
      .flow-card p {
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.55;
        margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
      }

      .ingredient-cloud {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.625rem;
        margin-top: 2rem;
      }

      .ingredient-cloud span {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 999px;
        color: var(--tomato-deep);
        font-weight: 750;
        padding: 0.625rem 0.8rem;
      }

      .flow {
        background: color-mix(in oklch, var(--tomato-soft) 38%, transparent);
        border-block: 1px solid color-mix(in oklch, var(--border) 80%, var(--tomato));
      }

      .flow-grid {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        margin-top: 2rem;
      }

      .flow-card {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 1rem;
        min-height: 14rem;
        padding: 1.5rem;
      }

      .flow-card:first-child {
        background: var(--herb-soft);
      }

      .flow-card:nth-child(2) {
        background: var(--lemon-soft);
      }

      .flow-card:nth-child(3) {
        background: var(--blue-soft);
      }

      .closer {
        align-items: center;
        display: grid;
        gap: 2rem;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      }

      .closer-card {
        align-items: center;
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 1rem;
        display: flex;
        gap: 1rem;
        padding: 1rem;
      }

      .closer-card img {
        background: var(--lemon-soft);
        border-radius: 0.875rem;
        height: 5.5rem;
        padding: 0.35rem;
        width: 5.5rem;
      }

      footer {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-inline: auto;
        max-width: 76rem;
        padding: 1.5rem 1rem 2rem;
      }

      @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
        .button:hover {
          transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .nav-links a:not(.button):hover {
          background: color-mix(in oklch, var(--surface) 72%, var(--lemon-soft));
          color: var(--ink);
        }
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
        .brand-mark,
        .mascot-orbit img {
          animation: mascot-breathe 4s var(--ease-out) infinite;
        }

        .preview-frame {
          animation: preview-rise 520ms var(--ease-out) both;
        }
      }

      @keyframes mascot-breathe {
        50% {
          transform: translateY(-0.18rem) rotate(-1deg);
        }
      }

      @keyframes preview-rise {
        from {
          opacity: 0;
          transform: translateY(1rem);
        }
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        *,
        *::before,
        *::after {
          animation-duration: 0.001ms !important;
          animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
          scroll-behavior: auto !important;
          transition-duration: 0.001ms !important;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 920px) {
        .hero,
        .signal-grid,
        .closer {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .hero {
          padding-top: 1rem;
        }

        h1 {
          max-width: 12ch;
        }

        .mascot-orbit {
          left: 1rem;
          top: 1rem;
        }

        .preview-frame {
          height: 36rem;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 680px) {
        .nav {
          align-items: flex-start;
        }

        .nav-links a:not(.button) {
          display: none;
        }

        .hero {
          gap: 1.25rem;
        }

        h1 {
          font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 14vw, 4rem);
        }

        .hero-actions,
        .hero-actions .button,
        .closer .button {
          width: 100%;
        }

        .preview-frame {
          height: 28rem;
        }

        .mascot-orbit {
          position: relative;
          width: 100%;
        }

        .flow-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .closer-card {
          align-items: flex-start;
          flex-direction: column;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="page-shell">
      <header class="nav">
        <a class="brand" href="/">
          <img class="brand-mark" src="/pen.svg" alt="" width="40" height="40">
          <span>PennyLunch</span>
        </a>
        <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Landing page">
          <a href="#intelligence">Intelligence</a>
          <a href="#flow">Kitchen flow</a>
          <a class="button button-primary" href="<%= recipes_path %>">Find tonight's dinner</a>
        </nav>
      </header>

      <main>
        <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="landing-title">
          <div class="hero-copy">
            <div class="hero-badge">
              <img src="/icon-64x64.png" alt="" width="28" height="28">
              Pantry-aware recipe AI
            </div>
            <h1 id="landing-title">Dinner from your pantry</h1>
            <p>AI ranks realistic recipes from what you already have, then shows the meal you can cook now.</p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a class="button button-primary" href="<%= recipes_path %>">Find tonight's dinner</a>
              <a class="button button-secondary" href="#intelligence">See how it works</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="PennyLunch app preview">
            <div class="mascot-orbit">
              <img src="/icon-512x512.png" alt="PennyLunch mascot" width="64" height="64">
              <div>
                <strong>Your pantry gets a point of view.</strong>
                <span>Ingredients become ranked dinner options, not another search box.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="preview-frame">
              <iframe src="<%= recipes_path %>" title="Live PennyLunch recipe discovery preview" loading="eager"></iframe>
              <span class="preview-ribbon">Live app preview</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="intelligence" class="section" aria-labelledby="intelligence-title">
          <h2 id="intelligence-title">The kitchen decides the ranking.</h2>
          <p class="section-intro">PennyLunch treats your pantry as the signal. Matches move forward, pantry staples stay secondary, and the next feasible recipe becomes obvious.</p>
          <div class="signal-grid">
            <article class="signal-panel signal-panel-large">
              <h3>Ingredient intelligence that behaves like a sous-chef.</h3>
              <p>The basket separates what matters from optional pantry noise, then pushes recipes with real overlap to the front.</p>
              <div class="ingredient-cloud" aria-label="Example ingredients">
                <span>tomato</span>
                <span>eggs</span>
                <span>parsley</span>
                <span>garlic</span>
                <span>pasta</span>
                <span>lime</span>
                <span>olive oil</span>
              </div>
            </article>
            <div class="signal-stack">
              <article class="signal-panel">
                <h3>Fast by default.</h3>
                <p>Quick and popular filters are always one tap away, so dinner stays a decision instead of a research project.</p>
              </article>
              <article class="signal-panel">
                <h3>Readable at cooking speed.</h3>
                <p>Cards lead with images, category, ingredient overlap, rating, and time. You can scan before the pan is hot.</p>
              </article>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="flow" class="flow">
          <div class="section" aria-labelledby="flow-title">
            <h2 id="flow-title">From fridge scan to dinner plan.</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">A tight workflow for the moment when everyone is hungry and the answer has to be practical.</p>
            <div class="flow-grid">
              <article class="flow-card">
                <h3>Add what you have.</h3>
                <p>Drop ingredients into the Market basket. Optional staples stay saved without distorting the match.</p>
              </article>
              <article class="flow-card">
                <h3>Rank the feasible meals.</h3>
                <p>The recipe list reorders around your basket, shortcut filters, category, rating, and total time.</p>
              </article>
              <article class="flow-card">
                <h3>Open the best fit.</h3>
                <p>The detail view keeps the image and ingredient list side by side, with matched rows marked clearly.</p>
              </article>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section closer" aria-labelledby="closer-title">
          <div>
            <h2 id="closer-title">Dinner software with taste.</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">PennyLunch is built like an AI startup and shaped like a kitchen tool: bright, fast, practical, and focused on the meal you can make now.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="closer-card">
            <img src="/pen.svg" alt="PennyLunch mascot" width="88" height="88">
            <a class="button button-primary" href="<%= recipes_path %>">Find tonight's dinner</a>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>

      <footer>
        PennyLunch turns pantry ingredients into relevant dinner recipes.
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
